# Keep the local-testing build context small. The Dockerfile only needs each
# app's renv scaffolding (renv.lock, renv/activate.R, renv/settings.json,
# .Rprofile) - not the large macOS-built renv libraries or git history.
**/renv/library/
**/renv/staging/
**/.git/
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
.sessions/
